    <p>The code-acceptance question for AI-assisted NDE: does ASME V Article 1 "personnel capable of performing the examination" extend to AI-augmented acquisition + interpretation? Industry consensus (ASME Section V Subgroup on Computed Imaging + API Committee on Refinery Equipment + IACS Rec-20) — yes, when: (a) procedure written + qualified + Level III approved; (b) AI model validated per a repeatable, reproducible, documented framework (ASTM E2491 + ASME PCC-3 + API 581 inspection-effectiveness factor); (c) acquisition operator trained per applicable inspector scheme; (d) human-in-the-loop Level III final disposition. Atlantis AI delivers the full code-acceptance documentation package out-of-box.</p>
